@MigraineDiary.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7190

### Регистрация

POST {{MigraineDiary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kirill",
  "email": "kirill@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123"
}

### Авторизация

POST {{MigraineDiary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kirill@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Текущий пользователь
# Вставить access token после Bearer

GET {{MigraineDiary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN